{"nodes": [{"id": "docs_javascript_pages_phase_3_functions_07_lexical_scope_01_the_scope_chain_lexical_scope", "label": "Lexical scope", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/javascript/pages/phase-3-functions/07-lexical-scope/01-the-scope-chain.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Fixed by where the function appears in the source, not where it is called. Makes closures possible and lets engines resolve names to slot indices."}, {"id": "docs_javascript_pages_phase_3_functions_07_lexical_scope_01_the_scope_chain_scope_chain_lookup", "label": "Scope chain lookup", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/javascript/pages/phase-3-functions/07-lexical-scope/01-the-scope-chain.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Walks outward and stops at the first match. Outer scopes cannot see inner bindings."}, {"id": "docs_javascript_pages_phase_3_functions_07_lexical_scope_01_the_scope_chain_what_creates_scope", "label": "What creates a scope", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/javascript/pages/phase-3-functions/07-lexical-scope/01-the-scope-chain.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Function bodies, blocks for let/const/class, modules, for heads with let/const, and catch. Object literals, if parentheses, templates, and var-in-a-block do not."}, {"id": "docs_javascript_pages_phase_3_functions_07_lexical_scope_01_the_scope_chain_shadowing", "label": "Shadowing", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/javascript/pages/phase-3-functions/07-lexical-scope/01-the-scope-chain.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "An inner binding hides an outer one for its scope and does not overwrite it. let cannot redeclare a parameter in the 